# Jumbalaya — project context

Roguelike **jumble** word game on Love2D/Lua. Active loop: fill **pattern puzzles** from a 7-card hand, bank score × multiplier, clear 24 stages (8 sets × 3 hands). Timeline fuse → tokens; between hands → The Trade marketplace.

**Authoritative docs:** `docs/code-organization.md`, `docs/gameplay.md`, `docs/testing.md`

## Layout

| Path | Role |
|------|------|
| `app/` | Bootstrap, lifecycle, input, persistence, engine (`app/core/`) |
| `packages/jumbalaya_core/` | Portable rules + store (no Love2D) |
| `packages/jumbalaya-engine/` | Engine services + retained UI |
| `bridge/` | `runtime.lua`, `funcs_registry.lua`, `store_sync.lua` |
| `word_game/` | Runtime glue, presentation, board (`config/`, `model/`, `ui/`) |
| `word_game/ui/sidebar/` | Right-hand HUD — use **sidebar** not vault |
| `tests/` | Headless suite — `love tests` |
| `dictionary/` | Offline word validation |
| `_tools/` | Python asset pipelines (not runtime) |
| `resources/` | Assets, shaders, sounds, fonts |
| `AlphaCardsBackup/` | Legacy card-engine reference — do not edit |

Agent docs: `AGENTS.md`, `.cursor/skills/jumbalaya/SKILL.md`

## Dependency rules

- `jumbalaya_core` → nothing in `app/` or `word_game/`
- `word_game/model/` → `jumbalaya_core` for rules; glue via `live_game()` / store — not a second copy of logic
- `word_game/ui/` → `app/core/` + `jumbalaya-engine` — never reverse
- `word_game/board/` — snap/geometry only; no UI imports at require time
- Cross-package: `WORD_GAME` + `WORD_GAME_UI` facades; model emits via `Presentation`, not `Funcs.dispatch`
- Runtime: `BridgeRuntime.game()` (shell), `WORD_GAME.store()` (run snapshot), `Funcs.dispatch` (UIBox strings)
- Bootstrap: `app/bootstrap.lua` only; `Game()` in `runtime_boot.lua` — no global `G` singleton

## Active vs legacy

Jumble mode is the player experience (`word_game/model/jumble/`, `word_game/model/jumble_play/`). Legacy AP/plays/discards code may remain but is not active — do not extend it unless asked. Right-hand HUD is `word_game/ui/sidebar/` (`WORD_GAME_UI.Sidebar`) — not vault.

## Verification

After logic changes: `love tests`. For structural refactors: `emmylua_check . --severity warn` (CI pins `emmylua_check` at error severity — see `docs/testing.md`). Minimize diff scope; match existing naming and patterns.
